{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":21355,\"tags\":[],\"year\":2016,\"idMal\":31240,\"staff\":[{\"id\":87665,\"name\":\"Masaharu Watanabe\",\"role\":\"Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":87666,\"name\":\"Jin Aketagawa\",\"role\":\"Sound Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":87667,\"name\":\"Kazuomi Koga\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":87668,\"name\":\"Tatsuya Koyanagi\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":87669,\"name\":\"Masahiro Shinohara\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":87670,\"name\":\"Daisuke Takashima\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":87671,\"name\":\"Hideyo Yamamoto\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":87672,\"name\":\"Yoshiko Nakamura\",\"role\":\"Script\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":87673,\"name\":\"Masahiro Yokotani\",\"role\":\"Script\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":87674,\"name\":\"Naoto Hosoda\",\"role\":\"Storyboard\",\"image\":null}],\"title\":\"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-\",\"format\":\"TV\",\"genres\":[],\"poster\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/305089-1.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"season\":\"\",\"status\":\"FINISHED\",\"titles\":{\"ar\":\"بدء الحياة من الصفر في عالم آخر\",\"de\":\"Re:Zero - Starting Life in Another World\",\"en\":\"Re:Zero - Starting Life in Another World\",\"es\":\"Re:Zero -Empezar de cero en un mundo diferente-\",\"fr\":\"Re:Zero –Starting Life in Another World–\",\"he\":\"רי:זירו - התחלת החיים בעולם אחר\",\"ja\":\"Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活\",\"ko\":\"Re: 제로부터 시작하는 이세계 생활\",\"pl\":\"Re: Życie od zera w innym świecie\",\"ru\":\"Re:Zero — жизнь с нуля в другом мире\",\"th\":\"รี:ซีโร่ รีเซทชีวิต ฝ่าวิกฤติต่างโลก\",\"vi\":\"Re:Zero – Bắt đầu lại ở thế giới khác\",\"x-jat\":\"Re Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu\",\"zh-Hans\":\"Re: 从零开始的异世界生活\",\"zh-Hant\":\"Re：從零開始的異世界生活\"},\"studios\":[],\"trailer\":{\"id\":\"IvhgOe9BY5A\",\"site\":\"YouTube\"},\"backdrop\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/graphical/305089-g.jpg\",\"duration\":25,\"episodes\":25,\"overview\":\"When Subaru Natsuki leaves the convenience store, the last thing he expects is to be wrenched from his everyday life and dropped into a fantasy world. Things aren't looking good for the bewildered teenager; however, not long after his arrival, he is attacked by some thugs. Armed with only a bag of groceries and a now useless cell phone, he is quickly beaten to a pulp. Fortunately, a mysterious beauty named Satella, in hot pursuit after the one who stole her insignia, happens upon Subaru and saves him. In order to thank the honest and kindhearted girl, Subaru offers to help in her search, and later that night, he even finds the whereabouts of that which she seeks. But unbeknownst to them, a much darker force stalks the pair from the shadows, and just minutes after locating the insignia, Subaru and Satella are brutally murdered.\\n\\nHowever, Subaru immediately reawakens to a familiar scene—confronted by the same group of thugs, meeting Satella all over again—the enigma deepens as history inexplicably repeats itself.\\n\\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"IvhgOe9BY5A\",\"name\":\"Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Subaru Natsuki\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/59385/image/tiny-18109888b2a8c79c387bd2ffe4867f3c.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Yuusuke Kobayashi\"},{\"name\":\"Bordeaux Zellgef\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/62133/image/tiny-283d75cba9f51a73b62f96c5cdf4afca.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Jirou Saitou\"},{\"name\":\"Aldebaran\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/62103/image/tiny-8cff13fea2ea33424ad7137c8f5dc8e9.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Keiji Fujiwara\"},{\"name\":\"Felix Argyle\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/62104/image/tiny-dee727ebe0d2d88f42037016faddf305.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Yui Horie\"},{\"name\":\"Priscilla Barielle\",\"rol